      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greensboro%2C_Maryland",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Greensboro’s riverside location made it a bustling inland port for transporting grain during the 18th and 19th centuries.",
